# Android / Wear quality

FitConnect Android is Jetpack Compose + Health Connect + Wear. Do not migrate the athlete UI to Expo/React Native.

Loop: IMPLEMENT → BUILD → INSTALL → LAUNCH → INTERACT → ASSERT → ACCESSIBILITY → PERFORMANCE → REGRESSION

Applicable tools: Gradle, Android lint, Detekt, ktlint, Kover when configured, ADB, emulator or physical device, Maestro for critical journeys, Compose UI tests.

Never claim UX works because `assembleDebug` succeeded.

Wear: glanceability, large touch targets, reconnect, battery-sensitive behavior. Do not copy phone layouts onto the watch.

This agent host is often Windows — iOS Simulator is unavailable here; Android emulator/device is the mobile runtime.
